# Bank Loan Risk Analysis – Tableau

## Overview

An end-to-end Tableau analytics project analyzing loan applications across multiple cities to understand loan volumes, approval patterns, and borrower characteristics.

## Business Problem

Analyze loan application data to identify patterns in loan status, loan purpose, employment type, location, and credit scores to support better understanding of loan approval trends.

## Tools & Technologies

- Tableau
- Data Visualization
- Interactive Dashboards

## Dashboard Features

- 3 organized dashboards
- 6 KPI cards
- Loan Purpose Bar Chart
- Loan Status Pie Chart
- State-wise Loan Distribution Map
- Interactive filters
- Cross-dashboard filtering

## Key Insight

Higher credit scores were associated with higher loan approval rates.

## Analysis

The dashboards enable drill-down analysis of loan volumes based on:

- Loan Status
- Loan Purpose
- Employment Type
- State
